scene: Every morning brings another anonymous quote in the papers, one wing of the party calling the other traitors and the other answering in kind. {rival} leads one wing and {colleague}, an old ally, leads the other, and both want {N} to choose before conference.
scene W: A leader is meant to lead the whole party, not one half of it. {N} believes there is a fair way through, if both sides can be brought to the same table.
